\pard\nowidctlpar\nooverflow\sl240\slmult1{\f0\lang1033\fs20\kerning28 This kit 
is very basic.  What you see in the schematics, is what you get in the kit.  I hope
 you have fun with this kit, and if it doesn\u8217\'92t work right away, troubleshoot
 the circuit, starting with the receiver circuit.  I\u8217\'92ve build this circuit
 at least 4 times, and I\u8217\'92ve modified it so that this this is what you get
.  Every time I build it, I make a mistake.  It is bound to happen.  \par}

